{"id":"460308c7099a8386","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-minimal-fixed-point.md","title":"最小 Kripke 固定点及超限构造","display":"df-minimal-fixed-point — 最小 Kripke 固定点及超限构造","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","aliases":["91-df-minimal-fixed-point","91-df-Kripke-minimal"],"display":"df-minimal-fixed-point — 最小 Kripke 固定点及超限构造","depends_on":["[[91-df-jump-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-minimal-fixed-point</span><span>91-df-Kripke-minimal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-minimal-fixed-point — 最小 Kripke 固定点及超限构造"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\">\\(J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a> 的正算子。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(C_T))\">\\(\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(C_T))\\)</span> 是禁止注入该幂集的最小序数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X:\\eta\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\">\\(X:\\eta\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\\)</span> 是由下述集合长度递归唯一确定的序列。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\\quad\nX_0=\\varnothing,\\quad X_{\\alpha+1}=J(X_\\alpha)\\quad(\\alpha+1&lt;\\eta),\\quad\nX_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}X_\\beta\\quad(0&lt;\\lambda&lt;\\eta,\\ \\lambda\\text{ 为极限序数}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\\quad\nX_0=\\varnothing,\\quad X_{\\alpha+1}=J(X_\\alpha)\\quad(\\alpha+1&lt;\\eta),\\quad\nX_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}X_\\beta\\quad(0&lt;\\lambda&lt;\\eta,\\ \\lambda\\text{ 为极限序数}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=\\min\\{\\alpha:\\alpha+1&lt;\\eta\\land X_{\\alpha+1}=X_\\alpha\\},\\qquad\nX_{\\min}\\coloneqq X_\\kappa=\\bigcap\\{Y\\subseteq C_T:J(Y)\\subseteq Y\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\kappa=\\min\\{\\alpha:\\alpha+1&lt;\\eta\\land X_{\\alpha+1}=X_\\alpha\\},\\qquad\nX_{\\min}\\coloneqq X_\\kappa=\\bigcap\\{Y\\subseteq C_T:J(Y)\\subseteq Y\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J(X_{\\min})=X_{\\min},\\quad\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X_{\\min}),\\quad\n\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\ (X_{\\min}\\subseteq Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J(X_{\\min})=X_{\\min},\\quad\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X_{\\min}),\\quad\n\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\ (X_{\\min}\\subseteq Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>超限递归在集合序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 上唯一。单调性使阶段递增；若始终不稳定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\mapsto X_\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\mapsto X_\\alpha\\)</span> 将违反 Hartogs 性质。结构子句保持信息一致性，极限并也保持一致。\n本次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 对应原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_1\">\\(X_1\\)</span> 不是全部算术真句；各标准算术句在有限正复杂度阶段取得正确值。全称量词可要求所有实例，整个真理闭包通常超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>。\n最小固定点提供 KF 的一个标准模型，不是 KF 选择的唯一模型。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 15.5、Lemmata 15.6–15.8、Definitions 15.9–15.11、Lemmata 15.12–15.14，印刷页 189–196，PDF 页 200–207。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)$ 为 [[91-df-jump-operator]] 的正算子。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(C_T))","display":false},{"tex":"X:\\eta\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\\quad\nX_0=\\varnothing,\\quad X_{\\alpha+1}=J(X_\\alpha)\\quad(\\alpha+1<\\eta),\\quad\nX_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta<\\lambda}X_\\beta\\quad(0<\\lambda<\\eta,\\ \\lambda\\text{ 为极限序数}),","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa=\\min\\{\\alpha:\\alpha+1<\\eta\\land X_{\\alpha+1}=X_\\alpha\\},\\qquad\nX_{\\min}\\coloneqq X_\\kappa=\\bigcap\\{Y\\subseteq C_T:J(Y)\\subseteq Y\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"J(X_{\\min})=X_{\\min},\\quad\\operatorname{ConInfo}(X_{\\min}),\\quad\n\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Fix}(J)\\ (X_{\\min}\\subseteq Y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\mapsto X_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"X_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1860,"backlinks":[{"id":"e9bbbe4420f54ce9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e382a4415fd419dc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"10229cf1ace7edd3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X_{\\min}$ 是 [[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]] 的极小一致固定点；$v_{X_{\\min}}$ 见 [[91-df-truth-value-function]]。"},{"id":"d154fdd64209bf0e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8e63bca271dfc8f1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"965681a90864b053","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)$、\n$\\eta=\\operatorname{Hartogs}(\\mathcal P(C_T))$、$X:\\eta\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)$、\n$\\kappa$ 及 $X_{\\min}=X_\\kappa$ 均采用 [[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]。"},{"id":"da74a4922b7a5745","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c096df80861122dd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"edf61bb893ee0ba7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3986b1fdb85a0caf","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-co